<title>UK: House of Fraser has poor Christmas-paper.</title>
<headline>House of Fraser has poor Christmas-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail group House of Fraser Plc will this week post a disappointing Christmas trading statement, paving the way for yearly profits well below last year's 14.3 million stg, according to a report in the Sunday Times.</p>
<p>Separately a report in the Independent on Sunday said the company will announce around 1,000 job cuts on Monday as part of a sweeping store closure programme.</p>
<p>No one at House of Fraser was available for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
